.TH LLPKG 1 "August 2026" "Linyaps 1.14.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
llpkg \- compatibility command for the Linyaps package manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B llpkg
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B llpkg
provides the legacy command interface implemented by the Linyaps command-line
client.  Use the command-specific help output for the complete syntax.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ll-cli (1)
